  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the rust-choked heart of Hunker's Junkers, 'Shatter' Spinter learned the value of a good scrap heap early. Parental units long gone, this Hatchling Shadow Marked survivor scavenged and brawled his way through Subchain City, honing his knack for turning trash into formidable weapons.",
    "class": "Brawler",
    "name": "Shatter Spinter",
    "personality": "Shatter is scrappy, resourceful, and undeniably surly. He trusts his instincts and his Whackers above all else. Despite his gruff exterior, he has a soft spot for underducks and will occasionally, grudgingly, lend a hand to those in need (if they can return the favor, that is).",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "\"Junk Fury\" - Shatter uses his knowledge of the junk heaps to improvise weapons on the fly. During combat, he can create a powerful temporary weapon from surrounding debris, significantly increasing damage for a short period.",
      "name": "Junk Fury"
